    "biography": "<p>@UUID[JournalEntry.azX1hjbc0PUp2AA2.JournalEntryPage.SSDCSJFv8Esl6Ki5]{Profile: Salt's}</p><blockquote><p><em>The ones who don&#39;t kneel.</em></p></blockquote><table class=\"sbn-ficha\"><tbody><tr><th>Type</th><td>Cerberus</td></tr><tr><th>Domain</th><td>The old shipyard and the Port of Everett</td></tr><tr><th>Location</th><td>@UUID[JournalEntry.JMwTSsJAcyYdCs3m]{Salt&#39;s Bar and the Old Shipyard}</td></tr><tr><th>Members</th><td>@UUID[JournalEntry.WHkwE8CYfaKW5WyO]{Rosa “Salt” Iturbe}, @UUID[Actor.k2TLqQkkzzjSLzkp]{Salt&#39;s Anarchs}</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The Anarchs of the Everett shipyard: they vote, they weld, and they owe nothing to any Prince.</p><h3>Domain</h3><ul><li><strong>Chasse 3:</strong> welders and longshoremen, some of them willing</li><li><strong>Lien 3:</strong> the union is theirs</li><li><strong>Portillon 2:</strong> a single highway, but the water has no doors</li></ul>",
